Upstream base: odoo/odoo 20.0 @ 09ea6518 (2026-10-06)
Full list of changes: git log 09ea6518..20.0-coop
Previous line: branch 19.0-coop (frozen; tags 19.0-coop-YYYYMMDD are kept).

Changes
-------
2026-10-06  Carried over from 19.0-coop (first made 2026-09-29):
            removed network calls to Odoo S.A. services (publisher warranty,
            website configurator and AI text, media library, odoo.com account
            OAuth); removed links to odoo.com (support, account, upgrade, app
            and theme stores, documentation) and the digest mobile banner from
            the user interface; removed "Powered by Odoo" and Odoo promotion
            from e-mail layouts, the invitation e-mail, the login page, the
            portal and the website footer (list: .coop/refresh-views.txt,
            .coop/refresh-templates.txt).
2026-10-06  New in 20.0: removed the website images API
            (website-image.api.odoo.com), editor translation through Odoo S.A.
            (Google Translate, ChatGPT) and "Sent by / Powered by Odoo" in the
            digest e-mail.
2026-10-06  Removed modules depending on Odoo S.A. services (generated list:
            .coop/removed-modules.txt, script .coop/strip.py; gate:
            .coop/check.py). 20.0 has no base_vat module: VAT checks are in
            base, VIES in l10n_eu_account_vies, which is removed.
            Copyright notices are preserved.

NO WARRANTY: see sections 15-16 of the GNU GPL v3 (included in LICENSE).

